usage: __main__.py [-h] --workspace-root WORKSPACE_ROOT [--create-workspace]
                   [--enable-models] [--enable-opm-workflow]
                   [--docker-executable DOCKER_EXECUTABLE]
                   [--resinsight-log-directory RESINSIGHT_LOG_DIRECTORY]

Launch workspace and configured ResInsight services over local standard input
and output.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --workspace-root WORKSPACE_ROOT
  --create-workspace
  --enable-models       Enable validated FIELD model import, creation,
                        inspection, and preparation.
  --enable-opm-workflow
                        Enable the bounded OPM model, well, job, result, and
                        native image workflow.
  --docker-executable DOCKER_EXECUTABLE
                        Use an explicit absolute Docker client path for the
                        OPM workflow.
  --resinsight-log-directory RESINSIGHT_LOG_DIRECTORY
                        Enable native session tools with an absolute, existing
                        application log directory.
